── history · History · read only · UTC ──
snapshot through #100 · exact subject sample:card ABC-42 @ https://one.example.test/
· Recorded observations; coverage may be incomplete. Not task intent or permission.
· Known recording gaps affect this scope; missing actions cannot be identified.
── history keys * ──
BROWSE RECORDED OBSERVATIONS
↑↓ move in the event list; scroll the focused detail
Home/End first/last event, or top/bottom of the detail
tab switch between the event list and detail
←→ focus the event list or detail
enter show the selected event's detail
PgUp/PgDn scroll the event detail from either pane
next page in this fixed snapshot  (n)
previous page in this fixed snapshot  (p)
refresh this scope from its first page  (r)
show all recorded events  (a)
show recent activity from the last 24 hours  (t)
show events with the selected event's exact causal root  (c)
show events for the selected exact action ID  (i)
extra history keys  (x)
? show or hide these history keys
esc back from keys; then close history

Pages contain at most 50 original observations, ordered by recording sequence (oldest first). Times are UTC; clocks can differ from sequence order.

Coverage may be incomplete. This view does not establish task intent, approval, or execution permission. A shared subject or work-map label never establishes a causal link.

